{%- comment -%}
  Single source of truth for the free-shipping / minimum-order threshold.
  Rendered (and captured) wherever the amount appears in copy, so it only
  needs to be maintained here. Can later be made country/currency-aware.

  Usage:
    {%- capture fs_threshold -%}{% render 'jkl-shipping-threshold' %}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign fs_threshold = fs_threshold | strip -%}
    {{ 'jkl.shop_minimum' | t: amount: fs_threshold }}
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- '499 kr.' -}}
